{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15213560","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213560","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521356001:0":{"text":"マルコさん……私たち、ついに一緒になれましたね！","source_cn":"马尔科……我们终于可以在一起了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x298554D9E4D004A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521356002:0":{"text":"信じてましたよ……あなたなら必ずやってくれるって……","source_cn":"你做到了……我就知道你一定可以的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9B0784846703CFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521356003:0":{"text":"うん、ありがとう……","source_cn":"谢谢你相信我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x663BC691313B541A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521356004:0":{"text":"でも本当は不安でした……もしあのまま死んだら、あなたが悲しむんじゃないかって……","source_cn":"我刚刚真的很害怕……害怕如果我真的死了，你也会难过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968D2634D59AFB65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521356005:0":{"text":"いいえ、お父さんは本当は優しい人だから。","source_cn":"不会，阿爹才不会那么狠心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA33A549555379F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},